text":"他憑著努力不懈的意志，終於攀上(  )的山峰，完成登峰壯舉。","n":30,"ssz":".....1........................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"車子開進深山後，四周(  )，連一戶人家也看不到。","n":25,"ssz":".1..............1.....1.."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了吸引觀眾，他在節目中(  )，故意說出誇張的話。","n":26,"ssz":"1........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"搜救隊找到受傷的登山客時，他仍(  )，立刻被送醫急救。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列文句，何者語詞使用最恰當？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這裡商店林立、遊客很多，是「杳無人煙」的旅遊勝地","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"電影最後的追逐場面十分緊張，看得大家「驚心動魄」","n":24,"ssz":"...............1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"醫生很快控制住病情，病人已經「回天乏術」","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他據實報告事情經過，故意「譁眾取寵」吸引注意","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"作者列出過去和現代的虎襲紀錄，最主要想說明什麼？","n":24,"ssz":"......1................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以前的老虎一定比現在更喜歡攻擊人","n":16,"ssz":".....1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"含光兄弟確實曾經在山上受到老虎攻擊","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老虎攻擊人的事件確實可能發生","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要山中有老虎，人類就可能受到攻擊","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"從含光救弟弟的過程，可以看出他當時怎麼做？","n":21,"ssz":".....1..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"先躲避老虎，等待其他人前來救援","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"先帶自己逃走，再回旅店尋求協助","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"冒著危險追趕老虎，設法把弟弟救回","n":16,"ssz":".............1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"判斷老虎力量較弱，才決定上前搏鬥","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"作者在Q1~Q4查證後，都用「目前判斷」說明結果。為什麼不直接寫成「答案」？","n":38,"ssz":".........................1............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"目前的結論受到證據限制，之後仍可能修正","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"找到的證據已經很充分，可以確定故事真假","n":19,"ssz":".........1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"網路資料大多互相矛盾，所以無法進行判斷","n":19,"ssz":".......1..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"古代故事年代太久，查到的資料沒有參考價值","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"作者最希望讀者養成哪一種閱讀態度？","n":17,"ssz":"..........2......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到年代久遠的故事時，先假定內容有錯","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到可疑的內容時，主動質疑並查找證據","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到驚險的故事時，特別注意人物的品格","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到網路上的資料時，只相信列出來源的內容","n":20,"ssz":"...........1........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜220字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"221~250字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞251字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（二    )開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":91,"ssz":"..................................................................1...1...1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.benchmark_instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎ 我的表現","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"康熙乙卯年（1675年）秋天，含光帶著小弟路過一","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"紅色 ☑（w:sym Wingdings F0FE）＋ 橘色手寫（字元樣式 af）","n":41,"ssz":"........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本文作者已經用Q1~Q4查過幾個讓人起疑的地方。不過，查到Q4，不表示所有疑問都解開了。讀完故事，你的心裡可能還會冒出一句：「等等，這裡真的嗎？」有疑問是好事，但不是每個不知道的疑問都值得花時間查。可以先問自己：\n1課文已經回答了嗎？\n2查清楚後，會不會影響我怎麼看這段故事？\n3這個問題有沒有辦法找到資料查證？\n如果「課文還沒回答、會影響判斷，而且查得到」，就值得繼續追。\n接下來，我們就接手作者還沒查完的疑點，一邊追問，一邊練習怎麼找資料、怎麼用證據判斷。","n":230,"ssz":"...............1........1..................................1.....................1..1........1...............................1...............1........................................1........................2....2................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本文作者已經用Q1~Q4查過幾個讓人起疑的地方。不過，查到Q4，不表示所有疑問都解開了。讀完故事，你的心裡可能還會冒出一句：「等等，這裡真的嗎？」有疑問是好事，但不是每個不知道的疑問都值得花時間查。可以先問自己：","n":106,"ssz":"...............1........1..................................1.....................1..1........1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1課文已經回答了嗎？","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2查清楚後，會不會影響我怎麼看這段故事？","n":20,"ssz":".......1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3這個問題有沒有辦法找到資料查證？","n":17,"ssz":"..1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"如果「課文還沒回答、會影響判斷，而且查得到」，就值得繼續追。","n":30,"ssz":".........................1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"接下來，我們就接手作者還沒查完的疑點，一邊追問，一邊練習怎麼找資料、怎麼用證據判斷。","n":42,"ssz":"...................2....2................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、還有什麼值得追？","n":10,"ssz":".......1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.根據本文，下面四個問題，選出兩個值得繼續查證的問題。（複選）","n":32,"ssz":"..........1......1.1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"弟弟喝下湯藥後，有沒有甦醒？","n":14,"ssz":".1............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"道士說「老虎牙齒有毒」，是真的嗎？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"含光追虎時，一共揮了幾下鞭子？","n":15,"ssz":"......1......1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"用嘴吸傷口，真的能幫助被老虎咬傷的人嗎？","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.為什麼2、4值得追？因為這兩個問題都：（複選）","n":25,"ssz":"..1......1...1..1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文還沒有回答。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"會影響我們怎麼看故事中的這個做法。","n":17,"ssz":".............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有辦法再找資料查證。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→接下來，就沿著這兩個問題往下查：先追Q5，再看看查到的資料會不會讓Q6更值得追。","n":41,"ssz":"..........1....................1......1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、追Q5：虎牙真的有毒嗎？","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）先想：要怎麼找？搜尋資料時，不是只打「老虎」就開始找。可以先從問題中抓出關鍵詞，讓搜尋結果更接近真正想查的內容。","n":59,"ssz":".................1........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.哪一組關鍵詞最適合查Q5？（單選）","n":19,"ssz":"...2..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老虎+凶猛+可怕","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老虎+虎牙+有毒","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].options.3","slug":