ext":"資料2｜哪些哺乳類真的會製造毒液？","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[12].rows[1][1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有些哺乳類真的會製造毒液，例如鴨嘴獸和懶猴。不過，這類動物很少；目前科學資料列出的有毒哺乳類中，沒有老虎。","n":53,"ssz":"..................1...1.............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.哪一份資料比較直接回答「虎牙有毒嗎？」","n":21,"ssz":"...1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"資料1","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[13].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"資料2","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.根據資料1、2，關於「虎牙有毒」的說法，哪一個判斷最適當？（單選）","n":35,"ssz":".......................11....1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"咬傷可能感染，所以虎牙就是有毒。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"虎牙沒有毒，所以只要防止傷口感染。","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options.3","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"咬傷可能感染，但沒有證據支持虎牙有毒。","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[14].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"兩份資料不同，所以還不能判斷虎牙有沒有毒。","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[15].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"◎查到這裡，我們發現：傷口可能感染，不等於虎牙有毒。這個發現，也讓我們更有理由追下一個問題：道士說要把「毒血」吸出來。如果虎牙有毒的說法沒有證據支持，那麼，用嘴吸傷口真的有幫助嗎？","n":90,"ssz":"...........................1.............11..............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[16].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三、追Q6：用嘴吸傷口真的有幫助嗎？","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[17].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（一）先判斷：哪一筆資料值得先看？","n":17,"ssz":"........2....1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[18].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.你用「動物